<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan cement firm postpones prospectus date.</title>
<headline>Pakistan cement firm postpones prospectus date.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Saadi Cement Ltd, which had been due to publish its prospectus on Sunday, now plans to release it on February 25, an official at the Karachi Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Saadi Cement Ltd has also postponed the subscription date for shares worth 462.5 million rupees to March 3 from February 26, the official said.</p>
<p>He gave no reason for the altered timetable.</p>
</text>
